{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:14 2026-11-23 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:05 2026-11-23 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:05 2026-11-23 HKT</p><img alt=\"資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/06cef23f83d3966170595861d9e9e060/2026-11/page_196.jpg\"/><p>今日（23日）早上9時02分，港鐵表示，由於何文田站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛，觀塘綫整體行車時間（總站至總站）預計需要額外10至15分鐘。事故維持約10分鐘，港鐵人員經處理，觀塘綫列車服務陸續恢復正常。</p><img alt=\"資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/5f2bd4371097ba2f3cac0bef2935b711/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-23_at_09_07_36.jpeg\" title=\"資料圖片\"/><p>資料圖片</p>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T01:43:27.197341+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T01:14:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T04:23:20.848914+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T01:37:25.021145+00:00","content_hash":"d49870ebce6d7b9564309fc6743fd7cfee78660777e571b081f0481b05ffab36","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}